g checks such as technical validation and customer profile were successful and therefore the payment initiation has been accepted for execution."),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](58,"tr"),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](59,"td"),r["\u0275\u0275text"](60,"AcceptedSettlementCompleted"),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](61,"td"),r["\u0275\u0275text"](62,"Settlement on the debtor's account has been completed."),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](63,"tr"),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](64,"td"),r["\u0275\u0275text"](65,"AcceptedWithoutPosting"),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](66,"td"),r["\u0275\u0275text"](67,"The payment instruction included in the credit transfer is accepted without being posted to the creditor customer\u2019s account."),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](68,"tr"),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](69,"td"),r["\u0275\u0275text"](70,"AcceptedCreditSettlementCompleted"),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](71,"td"),r["\u0275\u0275text"](72,"Settlement of the creditor's account has been completed."),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](73,"tr"),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](74,"td"),r["\u0275\u0275text"](75,"Rejected"),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](76,"td"),r["\u0275\u0275text"](77,"Payment initiation or individual transaction included in the payment initiation has been rejected."),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](78,"h2"),r["\u0275\u0275text"](79,"4.1 Domestic Payment Request [POST /domestic-payments]"),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](80,"p"),r["\u0275\u0275text"](81,"Once the domestic-payment-consent has been authorised by the PSU, the PISP can proceed with submitting the domestic-payment for processing:"),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](82,"ul"),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](83,"li"),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](84,"p"),r["\u0275\u0275text"](85,"This is done by making a POST request to the domestic-payments endpoint."),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](86,"li"),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](87,"p"),r["\u0275\u0275text"](88,"This request is an instruction to Absa as the ASPSP to begin the domestic single payment journey."),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](89,"li"),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](90,"p"),r["\u0275\u0275text"](91,"The PISP must ensure that the Initiation and Risk sections of the domestic-payments match the corresponding Initiation and Risk sections of the domestic- payments-consent resource. If the two do not match, the ASPSP must not process the request and must respond with a 400 (Bad Request)."),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](92,"li"),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](93,"p"),r["\u0275\u0275text"](94,"Any operations on the domestic- payments resource will not result in a status change for the domestic-payments resource."),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](95,"p"),r["\u0275\u0275text"](96,"4.1.1 Initiate payment request"),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](97,"p"),r["\u0275\u0275text"](98,"Create the payment initiation request to initiate the necessary accounting entries on the specified accounts depending on the payment type. The experience API will route the request accordingly to the relevant payment processor (Domestic low-value or Domestic high-value payments)"),r["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),r["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](99,"p"),r["\u02